  },
  {
    "page_number": 3,
    "bbox": [
      49.44,
      328.3,
      456.93,
      343.49
    ],
    "text": "For Multi-day boats in the West-Central Bay of Bengal deep sea areas.",
    "fonts": [
      "Cambria,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      12.479999542236328,
      12.960000038146973
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 3,
    "bbox": [
      36.0,
      360.17,
      562.08,
      417.91
    ],
    "text": "The Severe Cyclonic storm \u201cAkvan\u201d over South and adjoining West-central Bay of Bengal, lay centered, near Latitude 13.1\u00b0N and Longitude 85.4\u00b0E (approximately 680 km northeast to Trincomalee) at around 11.30 a.m. today (18th November 2026).",
    "fonts": [
      "Calibri,Bold",
      "Cambria"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      12.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 3,
    "bbox": [
      36.0,
      434.59,
      561.7,
      463.39
    ],
    "text": "Continuing to move north-northwestward, it is likely to cross Andhra Pradesh coasts between Nellore and Visakhapatnam, India around 11.30 am of 20th November.",
    "fonts": [
      "Calibri"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      12.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 3,
    "bbox": [
      36.0,
      482.23,
      562.02,
      527.95
    ],
    "text": "Therefore, Naval and fishing communities are warned not to venture to the deep-sea areas bounded by 10N-20N and 80E-95E, until further notice. Further, Naval and fishing communities operating in those sea areas are advised to move to safe areas.",
    "fonts": [
      "Calibri,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      12.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 3,
    "bbox": [
      36.0,
      540.79,
      561.72,
      569.74
    ],
    "text": "The naval and fishing communities, are requested to be attentive to the future forecasts and bulletins issued by the Department of Meteorology in this regard.",
    "fonts": [
      "Calibri"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      12.0
    ]
  },
